status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"source-proof-reviewed"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathrm{RE}\">\\(\\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathrm{RE}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\emptyset\\subsetneq\\mathcal C\\subsetneq\\mathrm{RE}\">\\(\\emptyset\\subsetneq\\mathcal C\\subsetneq\\mathrm{RE}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_{\\mathcal C}\">\\(I_{\\mathcal C}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ce9dbd1a2da08015\" href=\"?note=ce9dbd1a2da08015\" title=\"68-df-index-set\">68-df-index-set</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Recursive}\">\\(\\mathrm{Recursive}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"7fc8baae87b873a3\" href=\"?note=7fc8baae87b873a3\" title=\"68-df-recursive-set\">68-df-recursive-set</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"I_{\\mathcal C}\\notin\\mathrm{Recursive}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[I_{\\mathcal C}\\notin\\mathrm{Recursive}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 16.3 (Rice)，印刷 pp.59–60 / PDF pp.68–69。若空集属于 C，先转到 RE∖C；其指标集是原指标集的补集，可递归性相同。于是可取 A∈C 且空集不属 C。给定一个非递归 RE 集 B，参数定理产生全递归 S，使 W_(S(e)) 在 e∈B 时等于 A，在 e∉B 时为空；所以 e∈B↔S(e)∈I_C。若 I_C 递归则 B 递归，矛盾。原书陈述与证明已核对。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-recursively-enumerable-set","status":"resolved","id":"913d52943499d039","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-recursively-enumerable-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-recursive-set","status":"resolved","id":"7fc8baae87b873a3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-recursive-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-index-set","status":"resolved","id":"ce9dbd1a2da08015","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-index-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-thm-s-m-n-theorem","status":"resolved","id":"3b8f02ef6e351ea3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-thm-s-m-n-theorem]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-index-set","status":"resolved","id":"ce9dbd1a2da08015","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathrm{RE}$，$\\emptyset\\subsetneq\\mathcal C\\subsetneq\\mathrm{RE}$。$I_{\\mathcal C}$ 见 [[68-df-index-set]]，$\\mathrm{Recursive}$ 见 [[68-df-recursive-set]]。","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-recursive-set","status":"resolved","id":"7fc8baae87b873a3","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathrm{RE}$，$\\emptyset\\subsetneq\\mathcal C\\subsetneq\\mathrm{RE}$。$I_{\\mathcal C}$ 见 [[68-df-index-set]]，$\\mathrm{Recursive}$ 见 [[68-df-recursive-set]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathrm{RE}","display":false},{"tex":"\\emptyset\\subsetneq\\mathcal C\\subsetneq\\mathrm{RE}","display":false},{"tex":"I_{\\mathcal C}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Recursive}","display":false},{"tex":"I_{\\mathcal C}\\notin\\mathrm{Recursive}.","display":true}],"bytes":1272,"backlinks":[{"id":"be41c4d7dd143cb1","anchor":"ref-147","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-thm-rice-theorem]] — theorem"},{"id":"3cb8c24064050ea6","anchor":"ref-194","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-thm-rice-theorem|thm-rice-theorem — Rice Theorem]]"}],"outgoing":["913d52943499d039","7fc8baae87b873a3","ce9dbd1a2da08015","3b8f02ef6e351ea3"]}